* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
01  NATSEC-ACTIVE              (L)
            LOCAL
01  CMUB-CODE                  (B1) INIT <0>
01  CMUB-INFO                  (A32)
01  REDEFINE CMUB-INFO
    02  UB-1                   (N1)
01  CMUB-RETCODE               (N4)
END-DEFINE
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
CALLNAT 'NAT00040'
        USING CMUB-CODE
              CMUB-INFO
              CMUB-RETCODE
IF UB-1 = 0
   MOVE FALSE TO NATSEC-ACTIVE
 ELSE
   MOVE TRUE  TO NATSEC-ACTIVE
END-IF
END
